#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-isaac_sim.md:1 b4a92c258bf44676a929f5e5a2159022
msgid "Isaac Sim"
msgstr "Isaac Sim"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-isaac_sim.md:3 336c97caa6bd48fab1ca6aad85717cd1
msgid "Run robot demos with NVIDIA Isaac Sim for high-fidelity simulation."
msgstr "使用 NVIDIA Isaac Sim 运行高保真仿真机器人演示。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-isaac_sim.md:5 79f4e3b025b7421293265d934edcd5ac
msgid ""
"Use **FaSim-Isaac** `./init.sh` and `./run.sh`. Path and version live in "
"that repo’s config — do not hardcode a single Isaac minor version, and do "
"not invent CLI flags."
msgstr ""
"使用 **FaSim-Isaac** 的 `./init.sh` 和 `./run.sh`。路径和版本写在该仓库配置里 — 不要写死某一个 Isaac "
"次版本号，也不要发明 CLI 参数。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-isaac_sim.md:7 c2a23d6f17414bc0bdccb282822b76de
msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前提条件"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-isaac_sim.md:9 e1afe1e730a04313b7bd725b17d9a3df
msgid "NVIDIA Isaac Sim binary installed (GPU + matching NVIDIA drivers)"
msgstr "已安装 NVIDIA Isaac Sim 二进制（GPU 及匹配的 NVIDIA 驱动）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-isaac_sim.md:10 f50d974f4956436dbeb5bf8ec4ce806a
msgid "ROS 2 Jazzy workspace"
msgstr "ROS 2 Jazzy 工作空间"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-isaac_sim.md:11 1c1fc32cb37b4a688c2a9dfa42017d5b
msgid ""
"Default Isaac directory: `ISAACSIM_DIR` (`~/isaacsim` unless you override "
"it)"
msgstr "默认 Isaac 目录：`ISAACSIM_DIR`（除非覆盖，否则为 `~/isaacsim`）"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-isaac_sim.md:13 f904fc56d1b4421c89a6c8b1ff29177e
msgid "Steps"
msgstr "步骤"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-isaac_sim.md:15 0a330a667ace44f0b75e4d34b1fc70c7
msgid "1. Clone FaSim-Isaac"
msgstr "1. 克隆 FaSim-Isaac"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-isaac_sim.md:17 87a1d2ef1b8e4d7389206824c73eac8b
msgid ""
"cd ~/\n"
"git clone git@github.com:fiveages-sim/FaSim-Isaac.git\n"
"cd FaSim-Isaac"
msgstr ""
"cd ~/\n"
"git clone git@github.com:fiveages-sim/FaSim-Isaac.git\n"
"cd FaSim-Isaac"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-isaac_sim.md:23 78d126caff5048ab8ca52b548951b5fe
msgid "2. Initialize"
msgstr "2. 初始化"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-isaac_sim.md:25 6b40a2bdb5294f19b6ba87ab2d7fbc67
msgid "./init.sh"
msgstr "./init.sh"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-isaac_sim.md:29 a37ee2276b804a95a4554adbabecc0d3
msgid "What the script does (FaSim README):"
msgstr "脚本做什么（FaSim README）："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-isaac_sim.md:31 d09059dcf9b24d559bff2f8a9f5318ce
msgid ""
"**Operation 1** — initialize submodules listed in `.gitmodules` / "
"`submodules_visibility.conf` (`public` selected by default; `private` needs "
"access). Re-runs are additive."
msgstr ""
"**操作 1** — 初始化 `.gitmodules` / `submodules_visibility.conf` 中的子模块（默认勾选 "
"`public`；`private` 需要权限）。多次运行是追加的。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-isaac_sim.md:32 f0fd12ac142640209fab6e9761754540
msgid ""
"**Operation 2** — optional **Isaac ROS 2 Jazzy workspace**: version menu "
"queries GitHub stable tags (fallback list in `config/fa_sim.conf` currently "
"`6.0.1` / `6.0.0` / `5.1.0`). Override with `ISAAC_SIM_VERSION=… ./init.sh`."
msgstr ""
"**操作 2** — 可选 **Isaac ROS 2 Jazzy 工作空间**：版本菜单查询 GitHub 稳定 tag（回退列表见 "
"`config/fa_sim.conf`，目前是 `6.0.1` / `6.0.0` / `5.1.0`）。用 `ISAAC_SIM_VERSION=…"
" ./init.sh` 覆盖。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-isaac_sim.md:34 65632dbe7ae146a095c07b8415c535ae
msgid "3. Start Isaac Sim"
msgstr "3. 启动 Isaac Sim"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-isaac_sim.md:36 97270dcceddb47ce9556e0e39b86fc6c
msgid "./run.sh"
msgstr "./run.sh"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-isaac_sim.md:40 9ef6f0b920f647ae80ea026af967f6ce
msgid ""
"What the script does: optional CPU governor, optional Zenoh router if "
"`RMW_IMPLEMENTATION=rmw_zenoh_cpp`, then an interactive menu — **PhysX** / "
"**Newton** / **Headless Streaming**. There is no `./run.sh --robot` or "
"`./run.sh --headless`."
msgstr ""
"脚本做什么：可选 CPU 调频、若 `RMW_IMPLEMENTATION=rmw_zenoh_cpp` 则可选 Zenoh "
"router，然后是交互菜单 — **PhysX** / **Newton** / **Headless Streaming**。没有 "
"`./run.sh --robot` 或 `./run.sh --headless`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-isaac_sim.md:42 b1f6340e441444279bc45c0a8ecaab92
msgid ""
"Path/version overrides: copy `config/fa_sim.local.template.conf` → "
"`config/fa_sim.local.conf` and set `ISAACSIM_DIR` / "
"`ISAAC_SIM_DEFAULT_VERSION`. Env also works: `ISAACSIM_DIR=/path ./run.sh`."
msgstr ""
"路径/版本覆盖：复制 `config/fa_sim.local.template.conf` → "
"`config/fa_sim.local.conf`，设置 `ISAACSIM_DIR` / "
"`ISAAC_SIM_DEFAULT_VERSION`。环境变量也可以：`ISAACSIM_DIR=/path ./run.sh`。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-isaac_sim.md:44 efe349ae4e8144cdbe58dc28c7515186
msgid "4. Launch ROS 2 Side"
msgstr "4. 启动 ROS 2 侧"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-isaac_sim.md:46 d1955adf7b094294acefb4d9896d6a2f
msgid "In a new terminal:"
msgstr "在新终端中："

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-isaac_sim.md:48 890c5e62795048eaa7bda5cd409e163c
msgid ""
"source /opt/ros/jazzy/setup.bash\n"
"source ~/open-deploy-ws/install/setup.bash\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py hardware:=isaac"
msgstr ""
"source /opt/ros/jazzy/setup.bash\n"
"source ~/open-deploy-ws/install/setup.bash\n"
"ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller demo.launch.py hardware:=isaac"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-isaac_sim.md:54 e49cc1d77ad747849942db005c1e51ff
msgid ""
"Pass `robot:=…` on this ROS 2 launch as usual. Robot USD selection is done "
"by opening the asset under FaSim `robots/` (robot_usds) in Isaac — not a "
"FaSim `run.sh` flag."
msgstr ""
"照常在这条 ROS 2 launch 上传 `robot:=…`。机器人 USD 是在 Isaac 里打开 FaSim "
"`robots/`（robot_usds）下的资产 — 不是 FaSim `run.sh` 的参数。"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-isaac_sim.md:56 b182903792dc48ba947f1ce3593daeca
msgid "5. Verify Connection"
msgstr "5. 验证连接"

#: ../../source/2-how_to/4-isaac_sim.md:58 0899304cc43547b8aee5b300a6d8a23c
msgid ""
"ros2 topic list\n"
"# Should see /joint_states, /target_pose, etc."
msgstr ""
"ros2 topic list\n"
"# Should see /joint_states, /target_pose, etc."

